The game has potential. If you're looking for a game just to have fun, it's ok. if you're looking for a game to settle, this is not it. Has too many problems for me to recommend.
Pros:
+ The heroes are really different from the usual;
+ have amazing strategy potential;
+ Free, and not pay to win.
Cons:
-Poor balance. Very, very poor;
-Only one game mode;
-Matchmaking doesn't work. If you get matched with someone that has at least common sense, buy a lottery ticket;
-Very few heroes;
-The game rewards and encourage suicidal rushs at enemy base, which throws off the window any strategy potential it has.

Need to study for exams;
See steam sale on this game;
Buy Game;
Install Game;
Get addicted;
Fail on exams,
10/10, would fail again.

