The good:
-Unique music driven gameplay;
-Local 2 player Co-op;
-Achievements;
-Leaderboards;
-LastFM Scrobble support;
-Support Internet Radio.
The bad:
-Particle effect can cause headaches and other symptoms;
-Does not have a color blind mode
-User interface.
Score: 7/10.

You see, this is an awesome Star Wars game.
Pros:
- You can still play it online with non official servers;
- You can install a lot of mods that will improve your game experiense;
- With mods you can play in so different aeons (kotor, swtor, star wars vii, dark times, legacy, clone wars, etc);
- A stormtrooper/clone experience you won't feel in many other star wars games, because the majority is based on jedi x sith and lightsabers;
- Visit many warfares from beyond the galaxy far, far away;
- A lot of game Modes too (hunt, capture the flag, hero assault, conquest, assault);
- Fight space battles;
- Galactic Conquest;
- Nostalgia from the times you played this game;
- You can have the chance to play as heroes (han solo, luke, leia, darth vader, palpatine, yoda, windu, darth raven [with mods], etc...);
- Hype for Star Wars Battlefront. \o/
- Etc
Cons:
- Old game;
- If you are thinking it's ike any other fps like battlefield or cod, it isn't, you can't iron sight.
If you like star wars, this game is a must have.
